  "body": "Brand New | Modern Living | Private Outdoor Space\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to secure a brand-new home in the sought-after Bucklands Beach neighbourhood. With the vendor motivated to achieve a sale, buyers are encouraged to take advantage of this opportunity and make their interest known.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern lifestyles in mind, this beautifully finished home offers spacious open-plan living, a stylish contemporary kitchen and seamless access to a private outdoor entertaining area. Combining comfort, practicality and low-maintenance living, it's an ideal choice for first-home buyers, families and those looking to downsize without compromising on quality.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Desirable End Unit – Enjoy added privacy and a comfortable setting.\r\n• Modern Kitchen – Sleek cabinetry, quality appliances, generous bench space and a practical breakfast bar.\r\n• Light-Filled Living – Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas designed for everyday comfort.\r\n• Comfortable Bedrooms – Well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite.\r\n• Private Outdoor Entertaining – A generous timber deck, perfect for weekend BBQs, outdoor dining or relaxing with family.\r\n• Fully Fenced Backyard – Easy-care lawn and landscaped gardens, providing valuable outdoor space for children and pets.\r\n• Contemporary Finishes – Stylish bathrooms, modern lighting and a fresh neutral colour scheme throughout.\r\n• Brand-New Convenience – Enjoy the benefits of a newly built home with minimal upkeep.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Bucklands Beach Lifestyle\r\nConveniently positioned near local shops, supermarkets, cafés, schools and recreational facilities, this location offers excellent everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nBucklands Beach, Eastern Beach and Half Moon Bay Marina are also within easy reach, providing beautiful coastal surroundings and plenty of leisure options.\r\n\r\nA Genuine Opportunity – Make Your Move!\r\nWith only four homes in this boutique development, this is an opportunity worth exploring. The vendor is committed to selling and welcomes genuine interest from buyers ready to take the next step.\r\n\r\nDon't just add it to your watchlist – arrange your viewing and discover what this home has to offer.\r\n\r\nContact us today for further information or to arrange a private viewing.",
